    <h2 id="sw-head" class="sr-only">Committees and cells</h2>
    <div class="cols cols--2 reveal">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Anti-Ragging Committee</h3>
        <p>Ragging is a punishable offence. {{ site.name }} has zero tolerance for it, and the committee acts on every complaint.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Members:</strong> <span class="ph">[Chairperson name and designation, faculty members, student representatives, parent representative]</span><br>
          <strong>Contact:</strong> <span class="ph">[phone]</span> &middot; <span class="ph">[antiragging@citycollegemanagement.com]</span>
        </p>
        <p><strong>National Anti-Ragging Helpline:</strong> <a href="tel:18001805522">1800-180-5522</a> &middot;
          <a href="https://www.antiragging.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">antiragging.in</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Grievance Redressal Committee</h3>
        <p>For academic, administrative or fee-related grievances. Complaints are acknowledged and resolved within <span class="ph">[number]</span> working days.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Members:</strong> <span class="ph">[Chairperson, faculty members, student representative]</span><br>
          <strong>Contact:</strong> <span class="ph">[phone]</span> &middot; <span class="ph">[grievance@citycollegemanagement.com]</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Internal Complaints Committee (ICC)</h3>
        <p>Constituted under the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013. Complaints are handled confidentially.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Members:</strong> <span class="ph">[Presiding officer (woman faculty member), faculty members, non-teaching member, external member from an NGO]</span><br>
          <strong>Contact:</strong> <span class="ph">[phone]</span> &middot; <span class="ph">[icc@citycollegemanagement.com]</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>SC/ST and Equal Opportunity Cell</h3>
        <p>Supports students from Scheduled Castes, Scheduled Tribes, OBC, minority and differently-abled backgrounds, including help with scholarship applications.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Members:</strong> <span class="ph">[Coordinator and members]</span><br>
          <strong>Contact:</strong> <span class="ph">[phone]</span> &middot; <span class="ph">[equalopportunity@citycollegemanagement.com]</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
